Vectors in this directory (and reject/) are vendored verbatim from the Connect
repository, commit dbed16d387b88cbe028f73c451f0d6079da09ee9.

  https://github.com/dusk-network/connect
  vectors/typed-data-v1/*.json
  vectors/typed-data-v1/reject/*.json

They are generated in Connect by scripts/generate-typed-data-vectors.ts from
Connect's own reference implementation (src/typed-data/hash.ts) and copied
here byte-for-byte. Do NOT hand-edit any file in this directory or its
reject/ subdirectory, and do NOT regenerate them from the wallet side.

If a digest, intermediate, or error code needs to change, the change starts
in Connect: update the spec (docs/typed-data-v1.md) and/or the generator's
declarative vector list, regenerate there, let Connect's own byte-identity
test (that regenerates in memory and diffs against the committed JSON) pass,
commit, and only then copy the updated files here verbatim and bump the SHA
recorded in this file.

scripts/check-typed-data-fixture-parity.mjs (run via `npm run
test:typed-data-parity` and as part of `npm run test:run`) checks these
vectors against src/shared/typedDataHash.js on every run.
